# Short-circuit operators as control flow: `//` with die/fail/return/next,
# `//=`/`||=`/`&&=`, andthen/orelse/notandthen, `or die`, `and next`,
# `if ... -> $x`, and junctions in conditions.

=== ctl-defor-empty-slip
from: Air 0.1.32 lib/Air/Base.rakumod:326
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix //
